@startuml Template Method Pattern

title 模板方法模式 (Template Method Pattern)
caption 设计模式：模板方法模式 - 难度控制

abstract class AbstractGame {
    #initDifficulty()*
    #createEnemy()*
    #difficultyGrow()*
    #checkBoss()*
    +canSpawnBoss()
    +action() <<final>>
}

class EasyGame {
    +initDifficulty()
    +createEnemy()
    +difficultyGrow()
    +checkBoss()
    +canSpawnBoss() : false
}

class NormalGame {
    -timeCounter: int
    -enemySpeedMultiplier: double
    -enemyHpBonus: int
    +initDifficulty()
    +createEnemy()
    +difficultyGrow()
    +checkBoss()
}

class HardGame {
    -timeCounter: int
    -enemySpeedMultiplier: double
    -enemyHpBonus: int
    -enemyFireRateMultiplier: double
    -bossHpMultiplier: int
    +initDifficulty()
    +createEnemy()
    +difficultyGrow()
    +checkBoss()
    +onBossSpawned()
}

class Game {
    -difficultyStrategy: AbstractGame
    +action()
}

AbstractGame <|-- EasyGame : extends
AbstractGame <|-- NormalGame : extends
AbstractGame <|-- HardGame : extends
Game --> AbstractGame : uses

note left of AbstractGame
  角色：抽象模板类 (AbstractClass)
  定义模板方法和抽象钩子
end note

note right of EasyGame
  角色：具体子类 (ConcreteClass)
  无难度递增，不生成Boss
end note

note right of NormalGame
  角色：具体子类 (ConcreteClass)
  速度+10%, 血量+10, Boss血量不提升
end note

note right of HardGame
  角色：具体子类 (ConcreteClass)
  速度+15%, 血量+15, 射速-5%, Boss血量递增
end note

@enduml